+   Preempt — the observation chart.
+
+   A ward's own record of a patient is a printed chart: white paper, ruled
+   lines, one ink, and every number next to its unit. This page is that chart.
+   White by default and only white — a ward reads it at a station under
+   fluorescent light, and there is no camera image anywhere on it to protect
+   from glare. The one dark surface in the product is the drawn figure's field,
+   and even that is paper with a metre grid on it, because the figure is a plan
+   view in metres and not a photograph.
+
+   Contrast, computed from these hex values against #FFFFFF (and against --bg
+   #F5F3EE, which is the second number). WCAG AA for body text is 4.5:1.
+     --fg           #17181B   17.75 : 1   16.01 : 1
