+     --warn         #85550A    6.36 : 1    5.74 : 1
+     --ok           #2A6A45    6.47 : 1    5.83 : 1
+     --refuse       #3A5C66    7.23 : 1    6.52 : 1
+   Each tone also has a wash it is printed on, and the pair was measured:
+     accent on --accent-wash  8.35 : 1    danger on --danger-wash  6.87 : 1
